LearnSCADASim is proprietary software. It is free to download, but it is not open source.

Anyone may download LearnSCADASim from LearnSCADA's official release page and install and run it on their own
computers and networks. Without a license file from LearnSCADA it runs read-only: Modbus reads work and Modbus
writes are refused. A license file from LearnSCADA turns writes on, for the term and on the terms it is issued
under. Removing, disabling, or getting around the license check is not permitted.

